-- Case cut for L-meta-3057. The extra wire is NOT of the first pin. When there is no pin, or the
-- first pin is wire 0 or a wire from 9 on, that wire repeats a wire already there or is constant:
-- these are the cases of the checked L-meta-2913 (here with the input written as a number below
-- 512). What is left is a first pin among the inputs 1 to 8, where NOT x_k is a new wire.
